	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_013"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>セッカシティ　ね……▼
しきの　うつろい　というか
ふゆげしきが　すきな　まちね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:59:08" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
