		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_038"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>なあに？　なんだか
キーン　っておとも　するけど……▼
えっ　でんきいしのほらあな？▼
へー　ライブキャスターが
つうじるんだ！　はじめてしったわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:16:06" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>電気石の洞穴</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>電気石の洞穴</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_039"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ちょっと　こえが　とおいけど……▼
ネジやま？▼
なっとく！　ヤーコンさんの
やま　なのよねー▼
カセキが　みつかる　ばしょって
ママは　きいてるわ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:15:17" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ネジ山</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>ネジ山</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_040"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>リュウラセンのとう！
へー　なかに　はいれるんだ？▼
あれでしょ？　でんせつの　ポケモンが
ねむっているかも　しれない　ばしょね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:13:18" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>リュウラセンの塔</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>リュウラセンの塔</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>主人公ママ</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:26:51" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_041"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>チャンピオンロード！
しれんのみち　ね！▼
だいじょうぶ！　あなたには
ポケモンが　いてくれるでしょ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:12:45" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
