		</AttributeCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="MAP_STR_142"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>うみべのどうくつ　ね……▼
おおきな　いわを　いつのまにか
なみや　かぜ……　そして　ポケモンが▽
あなを　あけた　どうくつ　なのよね</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:43:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ゲート洞くつ（仮）</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:07" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>海辺の洞窟</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-12T12:41:58" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
